    apply (fire_via_ovf_lift tm Cc Hi (StD, S1)).
    intros p1 j1 E1. apply (fire_lift_of_csteps tm Cc).
    apply (fireo_1RB1LA_0LC1RD_1LA0RB_0LD1RC [SCycL 3 0; SWin 6] (StD, S1) ltac:(vm_compute; reflexivity)
