  unfold Cin_1RB1LA_0RC0RD_1LC0RA_0RB0LC, cden, BE0_1RB1LA_0RC0RD_1LC0RA_0RB0LC; cbn [c_st c_l c_h c_r].
  unfold sden; cbn [s_pre s_u s_a s_b s_post].
  replace (1 * j + 0) with j by lia.
  replace (0 * j + 0) with 0 by lia.
