Module LAPT_1RB1LA_0RC1RC_0LD0RB_0LA0RB.
(** * LAPT_1RB1LA_0RC1RC_0LD0RB_0LA0RB: TRANSITION-LEVEL board for machine 1RB1LA_0RC1RC_0LD0RB_0LA0RB, boarded by CERTIFICATE.

