  Cc p = cden (Ap_Alph_10_11_11 q0 ++ [S0]) [] j A0_1RB1LA_0RC1RC_0LD0RB_0LA0RD.
Proof.
  intros p j q0 E. destruct (Alph_10_11_11.cview_some_Alph_10_11_11 p j q0 E) as (H1 & _).
  unfold Cc_1RB1LA_0RC1RC_0LD0RB_0LA0RD, cden, A0_1RB1LA_0RC1RC_0LD0RB_0LA0RD; cbn [c_st c_l c_h c_r].
